      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقَّمَهُ الطَّعَامَ</span></b>  and 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيَّاهُ</span></b>  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْقَمَهُ</span></b>  [<i>He fed with
the food by the mouthful; put it into his mouth
by the mouthful</i>]: (Msb:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقَّمَهُ إِيَّاهُ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْقَمَهُ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيَّاهُ</span> <i>he put a mouthful</i> [<i>of it</i>] <i>into his mouth.</i>
(TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقَّمَهُ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْقَمَهُ</span></b>  [<i>He fed him by the
mouthful; put mouthfuls into his mouth</i>]. (S.)

